#: scenario7:scenario7_2917C442_2C2F_4A42_8209_D81D50F57791
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06ad1989ddf4970118c0b24d8ac4f1d4eaf7d8c712b31288aa4bdb476c93baf9
