msgstr "⟪k:0⟫당장이라도 무너질 것 같았기 때문이다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4A0A5FD6_4842_4075_A936_8A77F1032138
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99bbf6560ece059b63934f2d81ec30b63b684004a6f4353a9d0493256ab27236
