msgstr "⟪k:0⟫편지 끝부분에는 ⟪k:1⟫반드시 ⟪k:2⟫Michelle이란 사인을 넣었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_115FC035_3AAB_4941_9F70_A7FDD8BA7472
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 859f82c4f8e8ec6511e318d0ace14dcdec5db7cb9bd0529974548f960039c0ec
#. default-sha256: e4aec4d8acea3a202a683d637c431d674d443fb38d21944a4c5144063745d14a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_115FC035_3AAB_4941_9F70_A7FDD8BA7472"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the female name she bestowed upon me at birth, which I so despised."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어머니가 내게 지은 이름이자―― 내가 진심으로 혐오하는 여자의 이름."

#: scenario7:scenario7_8E96DBA4_1306_4485_9EFA_369E279396E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff97518fb9ae103098069d8240d5e2d19881997ed4a442b2a09a32befc4f5b76
